<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>GlassFolders</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>GlassFolders 0.7.4 Beta 2.4</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Beta 2.4：锁定 Liquid Glass 已确认的关闭态浅色基线与打开态连续高光几何；Clear 的“玻璃强度”改为主要控制局部模糊程度，白色透光/高光在低强度区间柔和建立后基本保持稳定。Clear 不添加任何彩色 tint，颜色仍只来自壁纸，并继续区分深色/浅色模式。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>风格</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Clear：颜色只来自壁纸/桌面 backdrop，本身不添加紫、蓝、粉等彩色 tint；使用比 Liquid Glass 更浅的局部 blur、更高的 backdrop 保留率与柔和白色高光。深色模式增加少量中性亮度/白色透光，浅色模式自动收弱。Liquid Glass：保持更厚的 blur / saturation 与更强白色镜面高光。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Style</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>Clear</string>
				<string>Liquid Glass</string>
			</array>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>玻璃强度</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>每 5% 一个档位。Clear：强度主要控制打开与关闭文件夹的模糊程度，白色透光/高光只在低强度区间柔和建立，避免越调越白；Liquid Glass：强度继续控制综合玻璃响应。建议先以 55% 为基准。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>cellClass</key>
			<string>GFPercentSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GlassStrength</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>55</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>关闭文件夹的 Liquid Glass 现在完整恢复到此前真机确认满意的较浅基线：原 blur / saturation、中性 brightness、白色透光、被动 SBHLibraryCategoryPodBackgroundView blend 与关闭态光照图均保持该基线。不主动调用 _updateVisualStyle；真实 App 资源库本身不会被 hook 或修改。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>应用并注销</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>respring</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>关于</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSTitleValueCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>作者</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>authorValue:</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
